        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27296</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27296"/>
        <updated>2025-07-15T10:40:51.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">Chrome 121 added support for the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Speculation-Rules#specifications" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Speculation-Rules</code></a> HTTP header, which also includes the <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Request/destination" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">Request.destination</code></a> value of <code class="notranslate">speculationrules</code>.</p>
<p dir="auto">See <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3217922770" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40289" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/40289/hovercard?comment_id=3071572654&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40289#issuecomment-3071572654">mdn/content#40289 (comment)</a></p>
<p dir="auto">Also see <a href="https://wicg.github.io/nav-speculation/speculation-rules.html#fetch" rel="nofollow">https://wicg.github.io/nav-speculation/speculation-rules.html#fetch</a> for the spec.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds a separate data point for the <code class="notranslate">Request.destination</code> value.</p>

<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>


<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>

]]></content>
