        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18311389?u=9ca7c2bf96b915fc275cfcb658fc3fb9ee2f1e0c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>

<p dir="auto">Change-set updates chromium support notes for <code class="notranslate">chrome_settings_overrides</code> given that it only has implementations for Windows and MacOS. Version numbers have also been updated to represent more precisely when these features where added.<br>
Next to this chromium requirements for <code class="notranslate">search_provider</code> properties have also been added as notes to the following properties;</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">search_provider.favicon_url</code>: Required and needs a HTTP or HTTPS URL which differs from Mozilla's implementation</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">search_provider.is_default</code>: Given it's a required property within chromium</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">search_provider.encoding</code>: Required in chromium when <code class="notranslate">search_provider.prepopulated_id</code> is not provided.</li>
</ul>
